ja ajaa vastustajat ansaan nettipokerissa. Pokerissa pelin ideana on voittaa mahdollisimman paljon rahaa.\",\"publishedDateTime\":1459350260000,\"image\":{\"name\":\"Poker images 4\",\"contentId\":\"contentid/1.734995\",\"self\":\"/onecms/proxy/content/contentid/policy:1.734995\",\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.ImageContract\",\"containingKmfEnabledContent\":false,\"title\":\"Poker images 4\",\"url\":\"https://fi.unibet.com/polopoly_fs/1.734995.1482141103!/image/1213488674.png\",\"imageLink\":\"/polopoly_fs/1.734995.1482141103!/image/1213488674.png\",\"contentIdString\":\"1.734995\",\"isReferenceContract\":false,\"appliedView\":\"teaser\",\"isVelocityEnabled\":true},\"categories\":{\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.MetadataContract\",\"entities\":[{\"name\":\"Poker\",\"id\":\"department.categorydimension.subject.poker\",\"dimensionName\":\"Subjects\",\"dimensionId\":\"department.categorydimension.subject\",\"url\":\"poker\"}]},\"amountOfLinks\":10000,\"theme\":\"no box\",\"isPersonalized\":false,\"contentIdString\":\"1.771719\",\"isReferenceContract\":false,\"appliedView\":\"teaser\",\"isVelocityEnabled\":true},{\"self\":\"/onecms/proxy/content/contentid/policy:1.754232\",\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.ArticleContract\",\"containingKmfEnabledContent\":false,\"name\":\"Kuinka lukea vastustajia nettipokerissa\",\"url\":\"https://fi.unibet.com/poker/guides/kuinka-lukea-vastustajia-nettipokerissa-1.754232\",\"leadInText\":\"Pokerinpelaajia on useaa eri sorttia. Jotkin pelaajat ovat hyvin johdonmukaisia ja pelaavat ainoastaan tietyllä käsivalikoimalla joko aggressiivisesti tai passiivisesti.\",\"publishedDateTime\":1458116752000,\"image\":{\"name\":\"Poker images 5\",\"contentId\":\"contentid/1.734996\",\"self\":\"/onecms/proxy/content/contentid/policy:1.734996\",\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.ImageContract\",