nty), toiselta nimeltään tyrmäysturnaukset (Knockout), ovat erittäin suosittuja.\",\"publishedDateTime\":1463729446000,\"image\":{\"name\":\"tile-getting-better\",\"contentId\":\"contentid/1.696151\",\"self\":\"/onecms/proxy/content/contentid/policy:1.696151\",\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.ImageContract\",\"containingKmfEnabledContent\":false,\"title\":\"tile-getting-better\",\"url\":\"https://fi.unibet.com/polopoly_fs/1.696151.1482141230!/image/3374961481.jpg\",\"imageLink\":\"/polopoly_fs/1.696151.1482141230!/image/3374961481.jpg\",\"contentIdString\":\"1.696151\",\"isReferenceContract\":false,\"appliedView\":\"teaser\",\"isVelocityEnabled\":true},\"categories\":{\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.MetadataContract\",\"entities\":[{\"name\":\"Poker\",\"id\":\"department.categorydimension.subject.poker\",\"dimensionName\":\"Subjects\",\"dimensionId\":\"department.categorydimension.subject\",\"url\":\"poker\"}]},\"amountOfLinks\":10000,\"theme\":\"no box\",\"isPersonalized\":false,\"contentIdString\":\"1.790167\",\"isReferenceContract\":false,\"appliedView\":\"teaser\",\"isVelocityEnabled\":true},{\"self\":\"/onecms/proxy/content/contentid/policy:1.747186\",\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.ArticleContract\",\"containingKmfEnabledContent\":false,\"name\":\"Miksi nettipokeri on niin suosittua?\",\"url\":\"https://fi.unibet.com/poker/guides/miksi-nettipokeri-on-niin-suosittua-1.747186\",\"leadInText\":\"Pokeri ilmestyi nettiin 90-luvun loppupuolella ja on sen jälkeen kerännyt tasaiseen tahtiin suosiota.\",\"publishedDateTime\":1455698519000,\"image\":{\"name\":\"teaser_poker\",\"contentId\":\"contentid/1.533271\",\"self\":\"/onecms/proxy/content/contentid/policy:1.533271\",\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.ImageContract\",\"containingKmfEnabledContent\":false,\"title\":\"teaser_poker\",\"url\":\"https://fi.unibet.com/polopoly_fs/1.533271.1482141827!/image/2314855773.png\",\"imageLink\":\"/polopoly_fs/1.533271.1482141827!/image/2314855773.png\",\"contentIdString\":\"1.533271\",\"isReferenceContract\":false,\"appliedView\":\"teaser\",\"isVelocityEnabled\":true},\"categories\":{\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.MetadataContract\",\"entities\":[{\"name\":\"Poker\",\"id\":\"department.categorydimension.subject.poker\",\"dimensionName\":\"Subjects\",\"dimensionId\":\"department.categorydimension.subject\",\"url\":\"poker\"}]},\"amountOfLinks\":10000,\"theme\":\"no box\",\"isPersonalized\":false,\"contentIdString\":\"1.747186\",\"isReferenceContract\":false,\"appliedView\":\"teaser\",\"isVelocityEnabled\":true},{\"self\":\"/onecms/proxy/content/contentid/policy:1.733771\",\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.ArticleContract\",\"containingKmfEnabledContent\":false,\"name\":\"Kuinka pelata Pot Limit Omaha -pokeria\",\"url\":\"https://fi.unibet.com/poker/guides/kuinka-pelata-pot-limit-omaha-pokeria-1.733771\",\"leadInText\":\"Unibet Pokerista löytyy paljon Pot Limit Omaha -pelejä, mutta PLO:hon totutteleminen voi viedä aikansa, jos on tottunut Texas Hold\\u0027emiin. Pelissä on useampia kortteja, ja korkea-arvoisimmat korteista esiintyvät useammin.\",\"lead\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eUnibet Pokerista löytyy paljon Pot Limit Omaha -pelejä, mutta PLO:hon totutteleminen voi viedä aikansa, jos on tottunut Texas Hold\\u0027emiin. Pelissä on useampia kortteja, ja korkea-arvoisimmat korteista esiintyvät useammin.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\",\"publishedDateTime\":1450453203000,\"image\":{\"name\":\"tile-pot-limit-omaha\",\"contentId\":\"contentid/1.696160\",\"self\":\"/onecms/proxy/content/contentid/policy:1.696160\",\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.ImageContract\",\"containingKmfEnabledContent\":false,\"title\":\"tile-pot-limit-omaha\",\"url\":\"https://fi.unibet.com/polopoly_fs/1.696160.1482141230!/image/85761627.jpg\",\"imageLink\":\"/polopoly_fs/1.696160.1482141230!/image/85761627.jpg\",\"contentIdString\":\"1.696160\",\"isReferenceContract\":false,\"appliedView\":\"teaser\",\"isVelocityEnabled\":true},\"categories\":{\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.MetadataContract\",\"entities\":[{\"name\":\"Poker\",\"id\":\"department.categorydimension.subject.poker\",\"dimensionName\":\"Subjects\",\"dimensionId\":\"department.categorydimension.subject\",\"url\":\"poker\"}]},\"amountOfLinks\":10000,\"theme\":\"no box\",\"isPersonalized\":false,\"contentIdString\":\"1.733771\",\"isReferenceContract\":false,\"appliedView\":\"teaser\",\"isVelocityEnabled\":true},{\"self\":\"/onecms/proxy/content/contentid/policy:1.738482\",\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.ArticleContract\",\"containingKmfEnabledContent\":false,\"name\":\"5 tapaa voittaa Pot Limit Omahassa\",\"url\":\"https://fi.unibet.com/poker/guides/5-tapaa-voittaa-pot-limit-omahassa-1.738482\",\"leadInText\":\"Olet nyt lukenut kaikki Pot Limit Omaha -artikkelit ja pelannut muutaman käden, joten sinulla on tuntuma pelistä. Miten sinun kannattaa edetä tästä eteenpäin?\",\"publishedDateTime\":1453215020000,\"image\":{\"name\":\"Pokercoach_5_b_ThrowingCards\",\"contentId\":\"contentid/1.48627\",\"self\":\"/onecms/proxy/content/contentid/policy:1.48627\",\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.ImageContract\",\"containingKmfEnabledContent\":false,\"title\":\"Pokercoach_5_b_ThrowingCards\",\"url\":\"https://fi.unibet.com/polopoly_fs/1.48627.1482142888!/image/473718715.jpg\",\"imageLink\":\"/polopoly_fs/1.48627.1482142888!/image/473718715.jpg\",\"contentIdString\":\"1.48627\",\"isReferenceContract\":false,\"appliedView\":\"teaser\",\"isVelocityEnabled\":true},\"categories\":{\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.MetadataContract\",\"entities\":[{\"name\":\"Poker\",\"id\":\"department.categorydimension.subject.poker\",\"dimensionName\":\"Subjects\",\"dimensionId\":\"department.categorydimension.subject\",\"url\":\"poker\"}]},\"amountOfLinks\":10000,\"theme\":\"no box\",\"isPersonalized\":false,\"contentIdString\":\"1.738482\",\"isReferenceContract\":false,\"appliedView\":\"teaser\",\"isVelocityEnabled\":true},{\"self\":\"/onecms/proxy/content/contentid/policy:1.730591\",\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.ArticleContract\",\"containingKmfEnabledContent\":false,\"name\":\"Omaha Poker aloittelijoille\",\"url\":\"https://fi.unibet.com/poker/guides/omaha-poker-aloittelijoille-1.730591\",\"leadInText\":\"Texas Hold\\u0027em on tällä hetkellä todella suosittua, mutta monet eivät tiedä, että Omaha on erittäin miellyttävä peli, joka pärjää hyvin vertailussa Hold\\u0027emia vastaan.\",\"publishedDateTime\":1450361718000,\"image\":{\"name\":\"tile-pot-limit-omaha\",\"contentId\":\"contentid/1.696160\",\"self\":\"/onecms/proxy/content/contentid/policy:1.696160\",\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.ImageContract\",\"containingKmfEnabledContent\":false,\"title\":\"tile-pot-limit-omaha\",\"url\":\"https://fi.unibet.com/polopoly_fs/1.696160.1482141230!/image/85761627.jpg\",\"imageLink\":\"/polopoly_fs/1.696160.1482141230!/image/85761627.jpg\",\"contentIdString\":\"1.696160\",\"isReferenceContract\":false,\"appliedView\":\"teaser\",\"isVelocityEnabled\":true},\"categories\":{\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.MetadataContract\",\"entities\":[{\"name\":\"Poker\",\"id\":\"department.categorydimension.subject.poker\",\"dimensionName\":\"Subjects\",\"dimensionId\":\"department.categorydimension.subject\",\"url\":\"poker\"}]},\"amountOfLinks\":10000,\"theme\":\"no box\",\"isPersonalized\":false,\"contentIdString\":\"1.730591\",\"isReferenceContract\":false,\"appliedView\":\"teaser\",\"isVelocityEnabled\":true},{\"self\":\"/onecms/proxy/content/contentid/policy:1.738403\",\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.ArticleContract\",\"containingKmfEnabledContent\":false,\"name\":\"Texas Hold\\u0027em -pokerin perusteet\",\"url\":\"https://fi.unibet.com/poker/guides/texas-hold-em-pokerin-perusteet-1.738403\",\"leadInText\":\"Nettipokeria on montaa eri sorttia, kuten seitsemän kortin avopokeria, Omahaa ja Texas Hold\\u0027emia.\",\"publishedDateTime\":1453204204000,\"image\":{\"name\":\"game tile texas hold em\",\"contentId\":\"contentid/1.658623\",\"self\":\"/onecms/proxy/content/contentid/policy:1.658623\",\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.ImageContract\",\"containingKmfEnabledContent\":false,\"title\":\"game tile texas hold em\",\"url\":\"https://fi.unibet.com/polopoly_fs/1.658623.1712145527!/image/3603101599.png\",\"imageLink\":\"/polopoly_fs/1.658623.1712145527!/image/3603101599.png\",\"contentIdString\":\"1.658623\",\"isReferenceContract\":false,\"appliedView\":\"teaser\",\"isVelocityEnabled\":true},\"categories\":{\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.MetadataContract\",\"entities\":[{\"name\":\"Poker\",\"id\":\"department.categorydimension.subject.poker\",\"dimensionName\":\"Subjects\",\"dimensionId\":\"department.categorydimension.subject\",\"url\":\"poker\"}]},\"amountOfLinks\":10000,\"theme\":\"no box\",\"isPersonalized\":false,\"contentIdString\":\"1.738403\",\"isReferenceContract\":false,\"appliedView\":\"teaser\",\"isVelocityEnabled\":true},{\"self\":\"/onecms/proxy/content/contentid/policy:1.734438\",\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.ArticleContract\",\"containingKmfEnabledContent\":false,\"name\":\"Kuinka pelata usean pöydän pokeriturnauksissa\",\"url\":\"https://fi.unibet.com/poker/guides/kuinka-pelata-usean-p%C3%B6yd%C3%A4n-pokeriturnauksissa-1.734438\",\"leadInText\":\"Useamman pöydän turnaukset eroavat rahapeleistä siinä, ettei niissä pysty lisäämään pelimerkkejä halutessaan, vaan niiden loppuessa tippuu pelistä. Palkintojärjestelmä tekee turnauksista kuitenkin houkuttelevia – saatavat palkinnot (raha tai pääsyliput suurempiin peleihin) ovat suuret suhteutettuna osallistumismaksuun.\",\"lead\":\"\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"line-height: 18.9091px;\\\"\\u003eTällä on vaikutusta valittuun pelistrategiaan. Toisin kuin rahapeleissä, sinulla on vain yksi “elämä” ja selviäminen on olennaista. Rahapeleissä chippisi vastaavat niistä maksamaasi määrää. Turnauksissa tämä toimii toisin – pelimerkkiesi arvo kasvaa sitä mukaa, mitä lähemmäs palkintosijoja pääset.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\",\"publishedDateTime\":1450791358000,\"image\":{\"name\":\"tile-tournaments\",\"contentId\":\"contentid/1.696165\",\"self\":\"/onecms/proxy/content/contentid/policy:1.696165\",\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.ImageContract\",\"containingKmfEnabledContent\":false,\"title\":\"tile-tournaments\",\"url\":\"https://fi.unibet.com/polopoly_fs/1.696165.1482141230!/image/1700178119.jpg\",\"imageLink\":\"/polopoly_fs/1.696165.1482141230!/image/1700178119.jpg\",\"contentIdString\":\"1.696165\",\"isReferenceContract\":false,\"appliedView\":\"teaser\",\"isVelocityEnabled\":true},\"categories\":{\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.MetadataContract\",\"entities\":[{\"name\":\"Poker\",\"id\":\"department.categorydimension.subject.poker\",\"dimensionName\":\"Subjects\",\"dimensionId\":\"department.categorydimension.subject\",\"url\":\"poker\"}]},\"amountOfLinks\":10000,\"theme\":\"no box\",\"isPersonalized\":false,\"contentIdString\":\"1.734438\",\"isReferenceContract\":false,\"appliedView\":\"teaser\",\"isVelocityEnabled\":true},{\"self\":\"/onecms/proxy/content/contentid/policy:1.734445\",\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.ArticleContract\",\"containingKmfEnabledContent\":false,\"name\":\"Lue nettipokerioppaasta ohjeet sittareihin\",\"url\":\"https://fi.unibet.com/poker/guides/lue-nettipokerioppaasta-ohjeet-sittareihin-1.734445\",\"leadInText\":\"Jos olet vastikään aloittanut nettipokerin, niin sittarit ovat sinulle täydellinen valinta; ne eivät maksa paljoa ja kestävät alle tunnin. Saat turnauksissa mukavan tuntuman pokerikäsien arvoista, pelimerkkien määristä, positiosta ja aggressiivisesta pelaamisesta.\",\"publishedDateTime\":1450791720000,\"image\":{\"name\":\"POKER GENERIC\",\"contentId\":\"contentid/1.625931\",\"self\":\"/onecms/proxy/content/contentid/policy:1.625931\",\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.ImageContract\",\"containingKmfEnabledContent\":false,\"title\":\"POKER GENERIC\",\"url\":\"https://fi.unibet.com/polopoly_fs/1.625931.1482141555!/rfpimage/156880872.jpg\",\"imageLink\":\"/polopoly_fs/1.625931.1482141555!/rfpimage/156880872.jpg\",\"contentIdString\":\"1.625931\",\"isReferenceContract\":false,\"appliedView\":\"teaser\",\"isVelocityEnabled\":true},\"categories\":{\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.MetadataContract\",\"entities\":[{\"name\":\"Poker\",\"id\":\"department.categorydimension.subject.poker\",\"dimensionName\":\"Subjects\",\"dimensionId\":\"department.categorydimension.subject\",\"url\":\"poker\"}]},\"amountOfLinks\":10000,\"theme\":\"no box\",\"isPersonalized\":false,\"contentIdString\":\"1.734445\",\"isReferenceContract\":false,\"appliedView\":\"teaser\",\"isVelocityEnabled\":true},{\"self\":\"/onecms/proxy/content/contentid/policy:1.734489\",\"contractInvalid\":false,\"contractType\":\"com.unibet.cms.contract.top.ArticleContract\",\"containingKmfEnabledContent\":false,\"name\":\"Sit \\u0026 go -turnaukset ja -strategiat \",\"url\":\"https://fi.unibet.com/poker/guides/sit-go-turnaukset-ja-strategiat-1.734489\",\"leadInText\":\"Todella suositut Sit \\u0026 Go -turnaukset muistuttavat pokeriturnauksen finaalipöytää, jossa toiminta alkaa nopeasti.\",\"pub